  },
  {
    "bg": "living",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "tv": "recording",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "电视里，林爷爷在左边，胡爷爷在右边。",
    "id": "day1-tv"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "tv": "recording",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "林爷爷伸手拿杯子的时候，画面里那只手慢了半拍才动。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "tv": "recording",
    "speaker": "我",
    "text": "这电视有点延迟。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "tv": "recording",
    "speaker": "舅公",
    "text": "老东西，能亮就行。",
    "next": "day1-observe"
  },
  {
    "bg": "photo",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "合照里有五个大人。二姨婆站在最边上，半只鞋没拍进去。",
    "id": "day1-photo"
  },
  {
    "bg": "photo",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "我在舅公怀里，手指抓着他的扣子。林爷爷的外套也是灰蓝色的。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "photo",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "背后写着日期，最后一位数字被相框压住了。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "photo",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "我记不清那天的事。母亲说我那时刚学会站，哪里都想去。",
    "next": "day1-observe"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "character": {
      "src": "assets/generated/characters/mugi.svg",
      "alt": "麦子的占位插画",
      "style": {
        "x": 0.56,
