        "width": 0.28,
        "height": 0.31,
        "opacity": 1
      },
      "animation": "none"
    },
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "它有狗那样的鼻子，耳朵却像折起来的叶子。前脚抓东西时，趾头会分开一点。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "character": {
      "src": "assets/generated/characters/mugi.svg",
      "alt": "麦子的占位插画",
      "style": {
        "x": 0.56,
        "y": 0.4,
        "width": 0.28,
        "height": 0.31,
        "opacity": 1
      },
      "animation": "none"
    },
    "speaker": "我",
    "text": "还记得我吗？"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "character": {
      "src": "assets/generated/characters/mugi.svg",
      "alt": "麦子的占位插画",
      "style": {
        "x": 0.56,
        "y": 0.4,
        "width": 0.28,
        "height": 0.31,
        "opacity": 1
      },
      "animation": "none"
    },
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "它站起来，把前脚搭在我腿上，又坐回去。小时候我总教它这么做。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "character": {
      "src": "assets/generated/characters/mugi.svg",
      "alt": "麦子的占位插画",
      "style": {
        "x": 0.56,
        "y": 0.4,
        "width": 0.28,
        "height": 0.31,
        "opacity": 1
      },
      "animation": "none"
    },
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "它又蹲回原地。我挠了挠它的下巴。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "character": {
      "src": "assets/generated/characters/mugi.svg",
      "alt": "麦子的占位插画",
      "style": {
        "x": 0.56,
        "y": 0.4,
        "width": 0.28,
        "height": 0.31,
        "opacity": 1
      },
      "animation": "none"
    },
    "speaker": "舅公",
    "text": "记得。你不来，它也认得你。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 14:32",
    "audio": "program",
    "character": {
      "src": "assets/generated/characters/mugi.svg",
      "alt": "麦子的占位插画",
      "style": {
        "x": 0.56,
        "y": 0.4,
        "width": 0.28,
        "height": 0.31,
        "opacity": 1
      },
      "animation": "none"
    },
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "我在掌心摊了一小块饼干。它先碰一下我的手指，才把饼干拿走。",
    "next": "day1-observe"
  },
  {
    "bg": "kitchen",
    "location": "一楼 · 厨房",
    "clock": "星期四 · 16:20",
    "audio": "kitchen",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "厨房的水龙头拧到底也会滴水。我把杯子倒扣在毛巾上。",
    "id": "day1-continue"
  },
  {
    "bg": "kitchen",
    "location": "一楼 · 厨房",
    "clock": "星期四 · 16:20",
    "audio": "kitchen",
    "speaker": "舅公",
    "text": "今天煮番茄面。你以前爱吃。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "kitchen",
    "location": "一楼 · 厨房",
    "clock": "星期四 · 16:20",
    "audio": "kitchen",
    "speaker": "我",
    "text": "现在也爱吃。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "kitchen",
    "location": "一楼 · 厨房",
    "clock": "星期四 · 16:20",
    "audio": "kitchen",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "二姨婆在门口问他放不放葱。他说少放，我说可以多一点。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "kitchen",
    "location": "一楼 · 厨房",
    "clock": "星期四 · 16:20",
    "audio": "kitchen",
    "speaker": "二姨婆",
    "text": "长大了。以前一根都要挑出来。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "kitchen",
    "location": "一楼 · 厨房",
    "clock": "星期四 · 16:20",
    "audio": "kitchen",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "碗还是以前那个，底下有一圈蓝边。我差点把面盛满，舅公说锅里还有。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "kitchen",
    "location": "一楼 · 厨房",
    "clock": "星期四 · 16:20",
    "audio": "kitchen",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "吃饭时电视关了。林爷爷把那件外套搭在椅背上，跟大家说公交车又改了路线。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "kitchen",
    "location": "一楼 · 厨房",
    "clock": "星期四 · 16:20",
    "audio": "kitchen",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "吃完林爷爷先走了。二姨婆帮着洗碗，胡爷爷又坐了一会儿。摄像机没人收。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-night",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 22:17",
    "audio": "night",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "晚上下来拿水，客厅只剩电视的待机灯。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-night",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 22:17",
    "audio": "night",
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "椅子上叠着几件忘了带走的衣服。灰蓝外套不在，细围巾倒还在扶手上。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-night",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期四 · 22:17",
    "audio": "night",
    "speaker": "",
